**Problem:** In `piece.py`, the `_get_captures_in_direction` method only checks captures in the initial direction (up for Player 1, down for Player 2) even for kings. According to standard checkers rules, kings can capture in all four diagonal directions (up-left, up-right, down-left, down-right). The current implementation restricts kings to capturing only in their player's default direction, which violates requirement #5 (applying standard capture rules).

